  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional 911 GT3 - 1:10 Scale Display Model Car. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the 911 GT3 - 1:10 Scale Display Model Car on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>911 GT3 - 1:10 Scale Display Model Car</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）-->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<!--创作者计划注释（无需改动）-->\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>911 GT3 - 1:10 Scale Display Model Car</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1290336-porsche-911-992-2-gt3-1-10-scale-model-rc-car?from=search#profileId-1320489\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">MakerWorld</span></strong></span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!--图片展示--> <img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/d7692ff3f8a142b1b6049913583c6b21/ZH100_KV.png\" height=\"1200\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"1920\"/></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 95px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">M3x8 BHCS Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">60 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">M3x16 BHCS Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">20 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">M3x5 BHCS Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">20 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px;\">M3x25 BHCS Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 20%;\">5 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
